# Local download notes / scratch (not code, not current docs)
/tmp

# datasets/baicao-knowledge: metadata tracked, payloads ignored
# Tracked: README.md, catalog.json, tasks/*, sources/*/SOURCE.md, sources/*/VIEW.md
# Ignored: 原文、抽取中间态、可导入快照、data/public 与 data/restricted 发布表
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/sources/*/source/
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/sources/*/processed/
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/sources/*/work/
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/data/
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/exports/
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/**/*.jsonl
/datasets/baicao-knowledge/**/*.parquet
